{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8b39feb96557395d","name":"Szygar","source":{"id":"source:reference-8b39feb96557395d","title":"Szygar","revision":23616,"timestamp":"2024-10-01T13:47:45Z","sha256":"0aac48f3221fed89660d93f3994d8a0c87f15c53a263b4580a112ab78b73b8df","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23616","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Szygar&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8b39feb96557395d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["The Queen of Air and Darkness"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Queen_of_Air_and_Darkness","referenceId":"reference:807bd67869870b44"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of the gamblers isn't going to accept his losses well. Midway through the third day, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Devaronian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Devaronian","referenceId":"reference:29582a7dcad88cd1"}," male named Szygar loses a particularly rich pot, going broke and getting eliminated from the tournament. Szygar isn't too pleased about his loss, and he is particularly upset at Lt. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armen Arandis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armen_Arandis","referenceId":"reference:22e366a95fbc40a5"},", who won the pot. Szygar accuses the officer of cheating, and while the Lieutenant sits calmly at the table, Szygar begins ranting and yelling that Arandis has been cheating the whole time (which is not true).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Heroes on the security team notice right away that Szygar is shaking his finger at Lt. Arandis and yelling, and as they watch, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Devaronian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Devaronian","referenceId":"reference:29582a7dcad88cd1"}," slides a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hold-Out Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hold-Out_Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:99ddc9f0285574f3"}," from his sleeve, leveling it at the Imperial officer. Though Szygar doesn't fire right away, the situation is precarious, and members of the security team will need to deal with it. Szygar is Hostile toward Lt. Arandis and Unfriendly to everyone else, but if a member of the security team can somehow shift his ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," to Indifferent, he's willing to lower the blaster. He still accuses Lt. Arandis of cheating, demanding that the officer be removed from the tournament and his winnings turned over to Szygar. If the heroes can convince the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Devaronian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Devaronian","referenceId":"reference:29582a7dcad88cd1"}," to leave peacefully and turn over his blaster, they will have successfully stopped a potentially deadly situation. However, they do not necessarily need to defuse the situation; if they have the means, they can try to take Szygar down violently.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For Szygar, use the statistics for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Goons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Goons"}," from the \"Sabacc Table Showdown\" (substituting in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Devaronian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Devaronian","referenceId":"reference:29582a7dcad88cd1"}," Species). If combat breaks out, use the map from the \"Sabacc Table Showdown\" encounter. Also, keep in mind that it's best for Lt. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armen Arandis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armen_Arandis","referenceId":"reference:22e366a95fbc40a5"}," to survive this encounter. His presence in the final round of the tournament will facilitate the revelation of Lady ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mirana Fioro"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mirana_Fioro?action=edit&redlink=1"}," as Darga's agent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Szygar Statisti